PT J
AU Valderhaug, VD
   Glomm, WR
   Sandru, EM
   Yasuda, M
   Sandvig, A
   Sandvig, I
AF Valderhaug, Vibeke Devold
   Glomm, Wilhelm Robert
   Sandru, Eugenia Mariana
   Yasuda, Masahiro
