PT J
AU Wang, J
   Ayari, MA
   Khandakar, A
   Chowdhury, MEH
   Zaman, SAU
   Rahman, T
   Vaferi, B
AF Wang, Jing
   Ayari, Mohamed Arselene
   Khandakar, Amith
   Chowdhury, Muhammad E. H.
